From 1c35bef6de5bd8a7c69f7b3c5874449c3489cbfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:30:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selection so pane text can be yanked

Terminal command mode supports focused-pane visual selection and clipboard yanks through the existing render path. The app routes visual-mode movement keys before prompt/chat editing so arrow-key escape sequences move the selection without leaving visual mode.
